[2026-03-14T21:47:45.585Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EkUfEZ2w5eDBguR1Pyx5fp","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive report:\n\n## Summary: Group By & Sort By Functionality in LinearClone\n\nI've completed a thorough search of the LinearClone app. Here's everything related to \"group by\" and \"sort by\" functionality:\n\n### 1. Main Components\n\n**GroupBySort Component**\n- File: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/GroupBySort.tsx`\n- CSS: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/GroupBySort.css`\n- This is a shared component used on the Team Issues page\n- Handles both grouping and sorting with dropdown menus\n- Default values: groupBy='status', sortBy='priority'\n\n**Related Components:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.tsx` - Implements the grouping/sorting logic for rendering issues\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/CycleDetail.tsx` - Has its own inline group/sort controls (similar structure but separate implementation)\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamFilters.tsx` - Filter toolbar (separate from group/sort)\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.tsx` - Bulk operations toolbar\n\n### 2. Group By Options\nThe following group-by options are available:\n- `status` (default)\n- `priority`\n- `assignee`\n- `project`\n- `label`\n- `none` (flat list)\n\n### 3. Sort By Options\nThe following sort-by options are available:\n- `priority` (default)\n- `created` (by creation date)\n- `updated` (by update date)\n- `status`\n\n### 4. Data-TestID Values Used\n\n**GroupBySort Component:**\n- `group-by-sort` - Main container\n- `group-by-btn` - Group by button\n- `group-by-dropdown` - Group by dropdown menu\n- `group-by-option-${value}` - Each group option (e.g., group-by-option-status, group-by-option-priority, group-by-option-assignee, group-by-option-project, group-by-option-label, group-by-option-none)\n- `sort-by-btn` - Sort by button\n- `sort-by-dropdown` - Sort by dropdown menu\n- `sort-by-option-${value}` - Each sort option (e.g., sort-by-option-priority, sort-by-option-created, sort-by-option-updated, sort-by-option-status)\n\n**CycleDetail Component (inline implementation):**\n- `cycle-group-by-btn` - Group by button\n- `cycle-group-by-dropdown` - Group by dropdown\n- `cycle-group-by-option-${value}` - Each group option\n- `cycle-sort-by-btn` - Sort by button\n- `cycle-sort-by-dropdown` - Sort by dropdown\n- `cycle-sort-by-option-${value}` - Each sort option\n\n**TeamIssuesList Component (rendering groups):**\n- `team-issue-group-${key}` - Group container\n- `team-issue-group-header-${key}` - Group header\n- `team-issue-group-select-${key}` - Group checkbox container\n- `team-issue-group-toggle-${key}` - Group toggle button\n- `team-issue-group-items-${key}` - Group items container\n\n**CycleDetail Component (rendering groups):**\n- `cycle-issue-group-${key}` - Group container\n- `cycle-issue-group-header-${key}` - Group header\n- `cycle-issue-group-items-${key}` - Group items container\n\n### 5. Redux Store Slices\n\n**teamIssuesSlice.ts** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamIssuesSlice.ts`)\n- State properties:\n  - `groupBy: 'status' | 'priority' | 'assignee' | 'project' | 'label' | 'none'`\n  - `sortBy: 'priority' | 'created' | 'updated' | 'status'`\n  - `selectedIds: string[]` (for bulk selection)\n- Actions:\n  - `setGroupBy(value)` - Updates groupBy state\n  - `setSortBy(value)` - Updates sortBy state\n  - `toggleIssueSelection(id)` - Toggles individual issue selection\n  - `selectGroupIssues(ids)` - Selects/deselects all issues in a group\n  - `clearSelection()` - Clears all selections\n\n**cyclesSlice.ts** (`/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/cyclesSlice.ts`)\n- Similar state and actions:\n  - `setCycleGroupBy(value)` - Updates groupBy state\n  - `setCycleSortBy(value)` - Updates sortBy state\n  - `toggleCycleIssueSelection(id)`\n  - `selectCycleGroupIssues(ids)`\n  - `clearCycleSelection()`\n\n### 6. Toolbar Structure (TeamIssues Page)\n\nLocated in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/TeamIssues.tsx`:\n\n```\n<div class=\"team-issues-toolbar\">\n  <TeamFilters />              (Status, Priority, Assignee, Label, Project, Cycle filters)\n  <GroupBySort />              (Group and Sort controls)\n</div>\n<BulkActions />                (Bulk update toolbar, shown when items selected)\n<TeamIssuesList />             (Displays grouped/sorted issues)\n```\n\n### 7. Seed Data\n\nFile: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\nThe seed creates:\n- **Engineering team** with issues having various:\n  - Statuses: `todo`, `in_progress`, `in_review`, `done`, `backlog`\n  - Priorities: `urgent`, `high`, `medium`, `low`, `none`\n  - Assignees: Alice, Bob, Carol, or unassigned\n  - Projects: V2 Launch project\n  - Cycles: Sprint 12\n  - Labels: Bug, Feature, Improvement, Documentation\n\n- **Design team** with similar variety\n\n### 8. Netlify Functions for Issues\n\nFile: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/team-issues.ts`\n\nServes issues with:\n- Query parameter: `teamId`\n- Returns:\n  - `issues`: Array with full issue details including labels, assignee, project, and cycle\n  - `members`: Team members for assignee filter\n  - `projects`: Available projects for filtering\n  - `cycles`: Available cycles for filtering\n- Query includes labels via `issue_labels` join\n- Issues ordered by `created_at DESC`\n\n### 9. Key Implementation Details\n\n**Grouping Logic (TeamIssuesList.tsx):**\n- Uses `useMemo` to compute groups based on `groupBy` and `sortBy` values\n- For each group type, creates an `IssueGroup` interface with:\n  - `key`: unique identifier\n  - `label`: display name\n  - `icon`: visual icon (status/priority icon or avatar)\n  - `issues`: array of issues in group\n- Issues can be collapsed/expanded per group\n- Group headers show issue count\n\n**Sorting Logic:**\n- `sortIssues()` function sorts issues based on `sortBy` type\n- Uses predefined sort maps (PRIORITY_SORT_MAP, STATUS_SORT_MAP) for consistent ordering\n- For date fields, uses newer dates first (DESC)\n\n**Selection:**\n- Individual issue checkboxes controlled by `selectedIds` state\n- Group header checkbox selects/deselects entire group\n- Selected count shown in BulkActions toolbar when items are selected\n\nAll files are located in:\n- **Components**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/`\n- **Redux Slices**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/`\n- **Pages**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/`\n- **API Functions**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n- **Seeds**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ae742cc0adfd78071 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 65616\ntool_uses: 27\nduration_ms: 34139</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bfa44b73-8bd5-4621-8202-172b5d211566","uuid":"f6cdaf3d-2f25-4c3e-a1d5-da22af7a98d1","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/LinearClone, find all components and code related to \"group by\" and \"sort by\" functionality. I need to understand:\n1. What components handle grouping and sorting (look for GroupBy, SortBy, group-by, sort-by patterns)\n2. The data-testid values used in these components\n3. How the toolbar/controls are structured\n4. The Redux store slices related to grouping/sorting\n5. The seed data (look for seed.sql or seed.ts)\n6. The Netlify functions that serve issues\n\nBe thorough - check src/components, src/pages, src/store, netlify/functions, etc.","agentId":"ae742cc0adfd78071","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive report:\n\n## Summary: Group By & Sort By Functionality in LinearClone\n\nI've completed a thorough search of the LinearClone app. Here's everything related to \"group by\" and \"sort by\" functionality:\n\n### 1. Main 